<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nokia buy restated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nokia buy restated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it reiterated its buy rating on Nokia Oy and set a 12-month price target of $72 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- sees wireless equipment stocks as well positioned against economic, technological and regulatory cycles.</p>
<p>-- said high-end fourth quarter earnings estimates of $1.02 per ADR &quot;could be light.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Nokia's ADR gained 2-1/4 to 62-3/4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
